              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Elite Cavalry and Muslim Cavalry have hand weapon, light armour, thrusting spear and shield. Eastern Shock Cavalry. Used to Elephants.</characteristic>
